{
 "_doc": "Scatter mesh data (plan-c-scatter.md 3.6, task S1). One file for every scatter mesh: slots (nominal heights and triangle budgets), the L0 procedural species (Tools/make_scatter_meshes.py), the CC0 sources (Tools/fetch_scatter_assets.py), the L1 Blender recipes (Tools/blender/prep_polyhaven.py, Tools/blender/make_bush.py). Units metres, +Z up, pivot at the base centre (written to glTF as +Y up, x,z,-y, the Blender exporter's mapping; Interchange maps it back to Z up, GLTFCore ConversionUtilities.h ConvertVec3). Every random draw comes from Mix32 (lowbias32) seeded by seed and the species stream. The rock slots are 1.2 m, equal to S2's palette RockNominalHM (TerrainScatterPalette.h), so the generator's sink (RockSinkFrac x RockNominalHM x scale) is 25 % of the real mesh height; test_rock_height_matches_s2_palette pins the two together.",
